{"id":"81768c5e3cc9d77d","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb7 Sauer Family","display":"df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family — ZFC Comb7 Sauer Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family — ZFC Comb7 Sauer Family","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family — ZFC Comb7 Sauer Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,n,d\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A,n,d\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SauerFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SauerFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 和序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}sauer\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SauerFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,n,d)\\leftrightarrow\nn,d\\in\\omega\\land d\\leq n\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(n)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in[n]^{d+1}\\;\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cap Y\\neq B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}sauer\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SauerFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,n,d)\\leftrightarrow\nn,d\\in\\omega\\land d\\leq n\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(n)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in[n]^{d+1}\\;\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cap Y\\neq B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last conjunct says that no <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(d+1)\">\\((d+1)\\)</span>-element subset is shattered, spelling out <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VCdim}(\\mathcal A)\\leq d\">\\(\\operatorname{VCdim}(\\mathcal A)\\leq d\\)</span> without an undefined VC-dimension operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。 对集合 $A$ 和序数 $\\lambda$，$[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}$，$[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A,n,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SauerFamily}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^\\lambda\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\lambda}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|<\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}sauer\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SauerFamily}_S(\\mathcal A,n,d)\\leftrightarrow\nn,d\\in\\omega\\land d\\leq n\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(n)\\land\n\\forall Y\\in[n]^{d+1}\\;\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\cap Y\\neq B)","display":true},{"tex":"(d+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VCdim}(\\mathcal A)\\leq d","display":false}],"bytes":1291,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1696","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family.md|58-df-zfc-comb7-sauer-family]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["2b6b1d9eb78a2714","2be08d4ee8aa1590","5582a281f15a33c2"]}